OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud will
OL,6,Fthicken overnight with outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain moving in from the north,
OL,8,Fhowever, some southern parts could
OL,9,Fremain dry until morning. Rather
OL,10,Fbreezy in places and feeling muggy
OL,11,Fovernight with temperatures hold up in
OL,12,Fmid-teens.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FCloudy skies and outbreaks of
OL,15,Flocally heavy rain are likely during
OL,16,Fthe morning. Turning drier into the
OL,17,Fafternoon as the rain becomes light
OL,18,Fand patchy. Lighter winds and feeling
OL,19,Fhumid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
